      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "AbaKanaani baseera abalsiraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omuKanaani, omuruchi waAradi, owamenya muNegebu, yahulila shinga abaIsiraeli olwa bali nibeetsanga khunjila yaAtsarimu; naseera Isiraeli, nahamba abandi khubo imbambe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Isiraeli niyeetsubila OMWAMI eshiitsubo, ari Noba niwakhahaana oluyia luno mumukhono kwanje, kho ndalamululila elala amatookho kabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI nahulila omwoyo kwaIsiraeli, nahaana abaKanaani mumakhono kabwe; nabo nibabamululila elala, namatookho kabwe kosi. Ne eliira liahabundu tsana liali Horama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tsinzokha tsiobufwisi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibachenda nibarula mulukulu lwaHori nibalonda khunjila eyitsia khuNyanza Inzakhanyu, okhubotokhana eshialo shiaEdomu; abandu nibasinyishila khunjila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandu nibabuutsuluulila Nyasaye, kata nende Musa, nibasunga bari Mbushiina nimukhutikulusiye okhurula eMisiri, mbu khufwile mushitsiimi? Okhuba omukaate kubulaho, khandi amatsi kabulaho; kata ebiliibwa bino ebibula obukhoonyi bikhusinyile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI naruma tsinzokha tsiobufwisi mubandu, natsio nitsiluma abandu; abandu abanji baIsiraeli nibafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho abandu nibamutsiila Musa nibasunga mbu Khwonoonile, shichila khumubuutsuluuliile OMWAMI, kata iwe wesi; osaaye OMWAMI, mbu akhurusiekhwo tsinzokha tsino. Mana Musa nasaayila abandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI namusunjila Musa ari Okhole inzokha yobufwisi, ochire khumusaala; mana kalaba mbu buli mundu oulumilwe, olwa achilola alaba omulamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Musa nakhola inzokha yomukasa, nachira khumusaala; nikaba mbu inzokha niyilumile omundu yesi, olwa yachihenga inzokha yomukasa eyo, yaba omulamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebikwo bietsinjendo tsiabalsiraeli muMoabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana baIsiraeli nibachenda, nibakhupa ikambi eObotsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibachenda nibarula eObotsi, nibakhupa ikambi eIye-abarimu, mushitsiimi eshihengana nende Moabu, eshihenga aha eliuba lifwindilanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibarulayo nibachenda nibakhupa ikambi mwibanda lieZeredi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibarulayo nibachenda nibakhupa ikambi injelekha waArinoni, okuli mushitsiimi nikurula munzakho tsiabaAmori; okhuba Arinoni nikwo olwakho lwaMoabu, hakari waMoabu nende abaAmori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko akachila nikahandiikwa mushitabu shiAmahe kOMWAMI mbu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "AbaIsiraeli bahula Sihoui",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Isiraeli naruma abarume ewaSihoni omuruchi wabaAmori, ari ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ofuchiilile embirile mushialoshio; shikhuleebera okhwinjila mumukunda kwosi, kata mumukunda kwemitsabibu ta; shikhulanywa khumatsi akomumayabo ta. Khulabirila khumuhanda kwomuruchi, okhuula olwa khulaba nikhubiriile olwakholwo lwosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Sihoni shiyafuchiilila Isiraeli okhubirila mushialoshie ta; ne yakhung'aasia abandube bosi, narula okhuseera Isiraeli mushitsiimi, niyoola eYahaza; nakhupana nende Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba Isiraeli nibabarootsa netsinganga, nibalia eshialo shiabwe okhurula khuArinoni okhuula khuYaboki, khushialo shiabaAmoni; okhuba eshialo shiabaAmoni shiali eshitinyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isiraeli nabukula amataala ako kosi; Isiraeli namenya mumataala kosi kabaAmori, muHeshiboni nomumataala kalio kosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba Heshiboni liali litookho liaSihoni omuruchi wabaAmori, owali niyaseera oyo owalinji omuruchi waMoabu, niyabukula eshialoshie shiosi okhuula khuArinoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako abareleesii betsinyimbo beembanga mbu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abalsiraeli bahula Ogu waBashani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa Isiraeli yamenya mushibala shiabaAmori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Musa naruma abandu okhuluura eYazeri, nibabukula amataala kalio; nibeelusia abaAmori abali nibalimwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibashiukhana nibatikulukha nibalonda khunjila yaBashani; naye Ogu omuruchi waBashani yarula okhubaseera, ye nende abandube bosi, okhuseerela eEderei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI namusunjila Musa ari Oramuria ta; okhuba emuhaanile mumukhonokwo, halala nabandube bosi, nende eshialoshie; nawe olamukholela shinga olwa wakholela Sihoni omuruchi wabaAmori, owamenyanga eHeshiboni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho nibamurootsa, nabaanabe, nabandube bosi, okhuula olwa yatong'a yenyene; nibalia eshialoshie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
